{
  "name": "JsonReadIsItemUntilTouch",
  "comment": "`(object,json)` → `(item,json)`: a json value narrows to dict so `%x.field%`\nnavigates it at runtime. There is no enduring PLang `object` type — item is both\nthe apex and the un-narrowed type. (The `is item`/`is dict` apex contract is\npinned in C# ItemApexTests; this goal proves the end-to-end narrow + navigation.)",
